  "body_html": "<h1>Induced Strategic Game</h1>\n<p>Given a direct mechanism \\(M\\), a utility function, and a true type profile, the\ninduced strategic game takes each agent's report space as the agent's strategy\nspace. The payoff of a report profile is the utility of the outcome selected by\nthe mechanism under the true type profile.</p>\n<p>The induced game is the bridge that lets mechanism-design predicates reuse\nnormal-form equilibrium and dominance notions instead of duplicating them.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[EconCSLib PR #27, blueprint/src/content.tex, def:md_basic_interface] EconCSLib pull request #27, https://github.com/gametheoryinlean/EconCSLib/pull/27. Migrated from the PR's old leanblueprint section into mdblueprint staged form.</li>\n</ul>",
